### Task Hub Backend API Tests
### Use REST Client extension in VS Code or similar tool

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = 

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### 2. Root Endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 3. Sign Up
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 4. Sign In
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 5. Get Current User (Replace @token with token from signup/signin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Create Task
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete project documentation",
  "description": "Write comprehensive documentation for the project",
  "priority": "high",
  "date": "2025-12-15",
  "timeStart": "09:00 AM",
  "timeEnd": "11:00 AM",
  "referenceLinks": ["https://example.com/docs"]
}

### 7. Get All Tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Get Tasks by Date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?date=2025-12-15
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Get Tasks by Month
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?month=2025-12
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Get Single Task (Replace :id with actual task ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/:id
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Update Task
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/:id
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated task title",
  "priority": "medium"
}

### 12. Toggle Task Completion
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/:id/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Delete Task
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/:id
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. Analytics - Overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. Analytics - Task Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/task-status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. Analytics - Weekly Distribution
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/weekly-distribution
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. Analytics - Priority Distribution
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/priority-distribution
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 18. Analytics - Monthly Trend
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/monthly-trend
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 19. Get User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 20. Update User Profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe Updated",
  "title": "Senior Engineer"
}

### 21. Change Password
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/user/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "password123",
  "newPassword": "newpassword123"
}

### 22. AI Chat
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Help me organize my tasks for this week"
}

### 23. Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

